#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/operations.md:44
msgid "The package does not declare a bare `relic` console script. The Python module commands above are the stable callable surfaces documented for this architecture version:"
msgstr "该软件包未声明裸 `relic` 控制台脚本。上述 Python 模块命令是本架构版本记录的稳定可调用入口："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/operations.md:48
msgid "`python -m relic.interfaces.cli.main` exposes seven top-level subcommands: `params`, `optimization` (alias `opt`, `[N]` `runtime_unbound`; `FourDVar` in `relic.optimization.assimilation` is an unimplemented `[N]` framework shell without an adjoint model), `data`, `compute`, `stochastic` (alias `stoch`), `orchestration` (alias `graph`), and `healthcheck` (alias `health`)."
msgstr "`python -m relic.interfaces.cli.main` 提供七个顶层子命令：`params`、`optimization`（别名 `opt`，`[N]` `runtime_unbound`；`relic.optimization.assimilation` 中的 `FourDVar` 是未实现的 `[N]` 框架外壳，不含伴随模型）、`data`、`compute`、`stochastic`（别名 `stoch`）、`orchestration`（别名 `graph`）以及 `healthcheck`（别名 `health`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/operations.md:53
msgid "`python -m relic.orchestration` exposes `validate` and `compile` for `GraphIR` files."
msgstr "`python -m relic.orchestration` 为 `GraphIR` 文件提供 `validate` 与 `compile` 子命令。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/operations.md:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`RELICSimulator(None)` normalizes `None` to the empty configuration `{}`, defaulting `enable_auto_scale` to `False`. `resolve_device(...)` follows a GPU-first policy for distributed and `auto` selection with automatic fallback to CPU when CUDA is unavailable (unless `require_gpu=True`), whereas an explicit `enable_distributed: true` setting that cannot be satisfied raises `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "`RELICSimulator(None)` 会将 `None` 规范化为空配置 `{}`，其中 `enable_auto_scale` 默认设为 `False`。`resolve_device(...)` 对分布式与 `auto` 设备选择采用 GPU 优先策略，在 CUDA 不可用时回退至 CPU（除非设置了 `require_gpu=True`）；若显式设置的 `enable_distributed: true` 无法满足，则抛出 `RuntimeError`。"

