#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/operations.md:139
msgid "Interpret the three lines separately: the managed state advanced from 1 to 2, the simulator returned the single governed update key, and one step committed. The example is complete only when all three values match. It verifies the basic StateManager/Functor/simulator lifecycle; it does not validate a real ecological process, conservation law, GraphIR assertion set, or long-run numerical accuracy."
msgstr "三行应分别解释：受管理状态从 1 推进到 2；simulator 返回唯一受治理的 update key；一步已提交。只有三项全部匹配，示例才算完成。该示例验证基本 StateManager/Functor/simulator lifecycle；不验证真实生态过程、守恒律、GraphIR assertion set 或长期数值精度。"

